---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Community Engagement"
  description="Authentic and inclusive public and community involvement and engagement (PCIE) at the Sussex Cancer Research Centre."
>
  <section class="page-banner page-banner--image">
    <img src="/images/brand/hero-sussex.jpg" alt="" class="hero-bg" />
    <div class="hero-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container page-banner-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Lived Experience</span>
      <h1>Our cancer research is shaped by our local community, with international impact.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2>Designing a community engagement strategy</h2>
          <p>
            From day one we knew that our community would be our strength. The best cancer research
            happens in partnership with those impacted by cancer, and SCRC is committed to authentic
            and inclusive engagement with our local community.
          </p>
          <p>
            The{' '}
            <a
              href="https://www.bsms.ac.uk/research/support-and-governance/shcrp/sussex-health-and-care-research-partnership.aspx"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Health and Care Research Partnership
            </a>{' '}
            established the{' '}
            <a
              href="https://www.bsms.ac.uk/research/support-and-governance/shcrp/ren.aspx"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Research Engagement Network (REN)
            </a>{' '}
            in 2022 to work with local voluntary, community, and social enterprise organisations to
            engage underserved communities and embed community researchers across Sussex.
          </p>
          <p>
            We are proud to work with Sussex-based non-profit{' '}
            <a href="https://driorg.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Diversity Resource International
            </a>{' '}
            to listen to changing community needs and remove barriers so everyone in Sussex benefits
            from the leading cancer research happening here.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="split-media">
          <img
            src="/images/pages/unsplash-image--_5irj1f2ry-44afba84.jpg"
            alt="Community collaboration"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--bright">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">REN Cancer Project</span>
          <h2>Read the report, and how we’re implementing its findings</h2>
          <p>
            The REN Cancer Project collaborated with underserved communities to co-produce a Public
            and Community Involvement and Engagement (PCIE) plan for the Sussex Cancer Research
            Centre, utilising community researchers to bridge cultural and language gaps.
          </p>
          <p>
            Based on insights from 47 participants with lived cancer experience, the project has
            already led to the creation of a lived-experience advisory group and a community-led
            pilot project for breast and prostate cancer.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/news/ren-cancer-project-shaping-public-and-community-involvement-and-engagement-at-the-sussex-cancer-research-centre"
            class="btn btn--primary"
            style="margin-top:0.5rem;"
          >
            Read the Community Engagement Update →
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="split-media">
          <img
            src="/images/news/img_0504-2cf7a1c4.png"
            alt="REN Cancer Project community engagement illustration"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft section--tight">
    <div class="container container--narrow" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Want to help shape cancer research across Sussex?</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        If you want to know more, or explore how you or your community group can get involved, get in touch.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn--primary">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
